{{end}}{{end}}## Padding

Padding of $({{.PadH}}, {{.PadW}})$ adds a ring of zeros around every channel, turning ${{.Height}} \times {{.Width}}$ into ${{.PaddedH}} \times {{.PaddedW}}$. All windows below slide over these padded matrices. Channel R after padding:

