{{end}}(zero products are omitted). Summing the three channels: $y^{(0)}_{ {{- .I}}{{.J -}} } = {{.Total}}$

{{end}}### Per-channel partial responses

The channel sum above can be split into per-channel response maps: apply every kernel slice to its channel alone, over all positions. For filter 0:

